### 2.10  Content‑Security‑Policy (CSP) Example

If you ever serve HTML pages, set a restrictive CSP via helmet:

```js
app.use(
  helmet.contentSecurityPolicy({
    directives: {
      defaultSrc: ["'self'"],
      scriptSrc: ["'self'"],   // add hashes or nonces for inline scripts if required
      styleSrc: ["'self'"],
      imgSrc: ["'self'", "data:"],
      connectSrc: ["'self'"],
    }
  })
);
```

