## 2️⃣ Detailed Recommendations (with code)

Below is a **step‑by‑step upgrade path** you can copy‑paste into `app.js`. All changes are additive; they do not break the existing functionality.

### 2.1 Install Required Packages  

```bash
npm install helmet cors express-rate-limit express-validator morgan dotenv
```

| Package | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| **helmet** | Sets a comprehensive set of secure HTTP headers. |
| **cors** | Controls which origins can call the API (default deny). |
| **express-rate-limit** | Throttles repeated requests to mitigate DoS/brute‑force. |
| **express-validator** | Declarative request‑parameter validation/sanitisation. |
| **morgan** | Structured request logging (helps with audit & intrusion detection). |
| **dotenv** | Keeps secrets (e.g., API keys, JWT secret) out of source control. |

