```

**to**

```js
const { getSecret } = require('./lib/secrets');

app.get('/users', async (req, res, next) => {
  try {
    const validKey = await getSecret('API_KEY');
    // … continue with auth logic …
  } catch (e) {
    next(e);
  }
});
```

> **Why?**  
> * Centralises secret access.  
> * Lets you swap implementations without touching the rest of your code.  
> * Guarantees that production never falls back to a plain‑text env variable.

