 * Secure Express Application – based on OWASP Top 10
 * -------------------------------------------------
 * 1️⃣ Harden HTTP headers (Helmet)
 * 2️⃣ Enforce HTTPS & HSTS
 * 3️⃣ Disable X-Powered-By
 * 4️⃣ Add CORS policy (if needed)
 * 5️⃣ Rate‑limit public endpoints
 * 6️⃣ Centralised error handling & logging
 * 7️⃣ Authentication (JWT example) for protected routes
 * 8️⃣ Input validation (express‑validator)
 */

