| Change | Why it matters |
|--------|----------------|
| `helmet` + CSP | Sets dozens of OWASP‑recommended HTTP security headers (X‑XSS‑Protection, HSTS, Referrer‑Policy, etc.). |
| `disable('x-powered-by')` | Prevents leaking Express version. |
| `express.json({limit:'10kb'})` | Mitigates large‑payload DoS attacks. |
| `express-rate-limit` | Throttles abusive IPs (prevents credential‑stuffing, API scraping). |
